	<Title>HoloNET Holochain ORM</Title>
    <Description>HoloNET ORM — a powerful Object Relational Mapping layer for Holochain hApps built on HoloNET Client. Upgraded to Holochain 0.6.2. Map .NET classes directly to Rust DHT entry structs with HoloNETEntryBase and HoloNETAuditEntryBase. Batch-load entire DHT collections with HoloNETCollection<T>. Bind WPF/XAML UIs reactively with HoloNETObservableCollection<T>. Full CRUD (LoadAsync, SaveAsync, DeleteAsync), change tracking, version control, and one-method rollback — all without writing any conductor wire-protocol code. Converts any existing .NET app to a Holochain hApp with minimal changes. Ships as both lightweight (no binaries) and embedded (hc.exe + holochain.exe bundled) variants. Part of the OASIS Omniverse at https://holonet.oasisomniverse.one -- Source: https://github.com/holochain-open-dev/holochain-client-csharp</Description>
	<Summary Condition="'$(Embedded)' != 'true'">Powerful ORM built on top of the world's first .NET &amp; Unity Client for Holochain — now upgraded to Holochain 0.6.2 with Kitsune2 networking and the new conductor API.</Summary>
	<Description Condition="'$(Embedded)' != 'true'">Powerful ORM built on top of HoloNET Client for Holochain. Enables rapid hApp development via HoloNETEntryBase, HoloNETAuditEntryBase, HoloNETCollection and HoloNETObservableCollection — call Load, Save, Delete with automatic change tracking and rollback. Upgraded to Holochain 0.6.2. Lightweight version: use NextGenSoftware.Holochain.HoloNET.ORM.Embedded if you want the conductor auto-started.</Description>
	<Summary Condition="'$(Embedded)' == 'true'">Powerful ORM built on top of the world's first .NET &amp; Unity Client for Holochain, upgraded to Holochain 0.6.2, with hc.exe and holochain.exe bundled for automatic conductor management.</Summary>
	<Description Condition="'$(Embedded)' == 'true'">Powerful ORM built on top of HoloNET Client for Holochain. Same rapid hApp development experience as NextGenSoftware.Holochain.HoloNET.ORM — HoloNETEntryBase, HoloNETAuditEntryBase, HoloNETCollection, HoloNETObservableCollection — but references NextGenSoftware.Holochain.HoloNET.Client.Embedded so the Holochain Conductor (v0.6.2) is auto-started and managed for you. For the lightweight version use NextGenSoftware.Holochain.HoloNET.ORM.</Description>
